---
title: Document Workflow with Composite States
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB

    [*] --> Draft

    state Draft {
        [*] --> Editing
        Editing --> Reviewing : submit for review
        Reviewing --> Editing : request changes
        Reviewing --> [*]
    }

    state Review {
        [*] --> QA
        QA --> ApprovalPending : QA passed
        ApprovalPending --> Rejected : issues found
        ApprovalPending --> [*]
    }

    Draft --> Review : ready for review

    Review --> Published : approved
    Review --> Draft : needs revision

    state Published {
        [*] --> Active
        Active --> Archived : end of life
        Archived --> [*]
    }

    Published --> [*]

    note right of Draft
        User can edit and save
        document freely
    end note

    note right of Review
        Documents go through QA
        and approval process
    end note
